      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: welcome_to_melbourne_have_a_nice_day; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic_welcoming_message; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a family (two adults and a baby) and a dog in a sunny outdoor setting, with text overlay reading 'welcome to melbourne' and 'have a nice day'. The scene is warm, positive, and conveys hospitality and friendliness. There are no elements of toxicity, hate, abuse, or harmful stereotypes present. The intent is to welcome viewers to Melbourne in a cheerful, non-threatening manner, using the wholesome image of a family and pet to evoke positive emotions. The meme functions as a simple, benign greeting with no propagandistic, discriminatory, or harmful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
