      "description": "The target community is individuals arriving in or planning to visit Melbourne, Australia. The text 'welcome to melbourne' explicitly addresses newcomers to the city, and the warm, family-oriented imagery reinforces a hospitable greeting intended for tourists, travelers, or relocating residents. The meme functions as a friendly, non-toxic welcome message to this specific demographic.",
